""In 2010, Scott told the New York Times that Facebook was censoring classical paintings of nudes, which had been deleted from the accounts of many painters as well as established institutions such as the New York Academy of Art"".  I expect his involvement in this painting has made particularly sensitive to this issue, ",885,,,,,,,debounce,,
1,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,49,Male,sg_1776172371177_3voub3,diffuse,1,,art_history,high-art-history,How do ancient works of art play a role in contemporary society?,answer_snapshot,2026-04-14T13:32:14.254Z,,,,,,,"One of the most direct ways ancient works of art play a role in contemporary society is through its influence on current art styles and themes.

