2,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,33,Female,sg_1776172391075_2kvlx8,diffuse,0,1,practice,practice-capybaras,What do Capybaras eat?,paste,2026-04-14T13:15:07.436Z,,,,,,,,,,,"Capybaras are herbivores, grazing mainly on grasses and aquatic plants,[14][24] as well as fruit and tree bark.[15] They are very selective feeders[25] and feed on the leaves of one species and disregard other species surrounding it. They eat a greater variety of plants during the dry season, as fewer plants are available.",324,,,,,
