5,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,41,Male,sg_1776172728651_xarmvr,diffuse,0,1,practice,practice-capybaras,What do Capybaras eat?,answer_snapshot,2026-04-14T13:23:03.029Z,,,,,,,"Capybaras are herbivores. They graze on grasses and aquatic plants. They also eat fruits and tree bark. They are picky eaters who will eat leaves of one species while leaving other species surrounding it untouched. However, during the dry season when fewer plants are available, they eat a greater variety. ",307,,,,,,,debounce,,
