5,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,41,Male,sg_1776172728651_xarmvr,diffuse,1,,psychology,high-psychology,What brain mechanisms help people make scientific discoveries?,answer_snapshot,2026-04-14T13:25:18.283Z,,,,,,,Studies have found that the left hemisphere of the brain is important in scientific discoveries. IMRI investigation found that unexpected findings activated the prefrontal cortex of the brain. ,193,,,,,,,debounce,,
5,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,41,Male,sg_1776172728651_xarmvr,diffuse,1,,psychology,high-psychology,What brain mechanisms help people make scientific discoveries?,answer_snapshot_cursor_leave,2026-04-14T13:25:21.705Z,,,,,,,Studies have found that the left hemisphere of the brain is important in scientific discoveries. IMRI investigation found that unexpected findings activated the prefrontal cortex of the brain. ,193,,,,,,,cursor_leave,,
