10,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,27,Female,sg_1776173049411_uxap01,diffuse,0,1,practice,practice-capybaras,What do Capybaras eat?,answer_snapshot,2026-04-14T13:26:55.966Z,,,,,,,Capybaras are berivores and graze mainly on grasses and acquatic plants as well as fruit and tree bark. They feed on the leaves of one species and disregard the other species surrounding it. ,191,,,,,,,debounce,,
10,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,27,Female,sg_1776173049411_uxap01,diffuse,0,1,practice,practice-capybaras,What do Capybaras eat?,answer_snapshot,2026-04-14T13:27:07.058Z,,,,,,,Capybaras are berivores and graze mainly on grasses and acquatic plants as well as fruit and tree bark. They feed on the leaves of one species and disregard the other species surrounding it. They eat grass during the wet season. ,229,,,,,,,debounce,,
