10,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,27,Female,sg_1776173049411_uxap01,diffuse,2,,art_history,high-art-history,How do ancient works of art play a role in contemporary society?,article_open,2026-04-14T13:43:30.872Z,Ancient_art,Ancient art,,9179,link_click,,,,,,,,,,,,
10,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,27,Female,sg_1776173049411_uxap01,diffuse,2,,art_history,high-art-history,How do ancient works of art play a role in contemporary society?,answer_snapshot,2026-04-14T13:44:38.246Z,,,,,,,"Many of these ancient arts are still open to viewing by the public in contemporary society and many people often travel to view these pieces of art. Many contemporary art pieces are a dynamic combination of materials, methods, concepts and subjects from different eras - they challenged boundaries. A lot of the recurring images from ancient art is still seen in the modern world today. ",387,,,,,,,debounce,,
10,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,27,Female,sg_1776173049411_uxap01,diffuse,2,,art_history,high-art-history,How do ancient works of art play a role in contemporary society?,answer_snapshot_cursor_leave,2026-04-14T13:44:39.921Z,,,,,,,"Many of these ancient arts are still open to viewing by the public in contemporary society and many people often travel to view these pieces of art. Many contemporary art pieces are a dynamic combination of materials, methods, concepts and subjects from different eras - they challenged boundaries. A lot of the recurring images from ancient art is still seen in the modern world today. ",387,,,,,,,cursor_leave,,
