10,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,27,Female,sg_1776173049411_uxap01,diffuse,2,,art_history,high-art-history,How do ancient works of art play a role in contemporary society?,article_open,2026-04-14T13:47:14.564Z,Metropolitan_Museum_of_Art,Metropolitan Museum of Art,,25318,search,,,,,,,,,,,,
10,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,27,Female,sg_1776173049411_uxap01,diffuse,2,,art_history,high-art-history,How do ancient works of art play a role in contemporary society?,paste,2026-04-14T13:47:27.766Z,,,,,,,,,,,"The Metropolitan Museum of Art, colloquially referred to as the Met, is an encyclopedic art museum in New York City. By floor area, it is the fourth-largest museum in the world and the largest art museum in the Americas. With 5,727,258 visitors in fiscal year 2025, it was the most-visited museum in the United States and the fourth-most visited art museum in the world.[7]",373,,,,,
10,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,27,Female,sg_1776173049411_uxap01,diffuse,2,,art_history,high-art-history,How do ancient works of art play a role in contemporary society?,answer_snapshot_cursor_leave,2026-04-14T13:47:29.681Z,,,,,,,"Many of these ancient arts are still open to viewing by the public in contemporary society and many people often travel to view these pieces of art. Many contemporary art pieces are a dynamic combination of materials, methods, concepts and subjects from different eras - they challenged boundaries. A lot of the recurring images from ancient art is still seen in the modern world today. 

The Metropolitan Museum of Art, colloquially referred to as the Met, is an encyclopedic art museum in New York City. By floor area, it is the fourth-largest museum in the world and the largest art museum in the Americas. With 5,727,258 visitors in fiscal year 2025, it was the most-visited museum in the United States and the fourth-most visited art museum in the world.[7]",762,,,,,,,cursor_leave,,
