Going deeper into the brain, the synapses are the key functional elements of the brain. The essential function of the brain is cell-to-cell communication, and synapses are the points at which communication occurs. Without this the brain would not work or even begin to think about science.",524,,,,,,,submit,,
11,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,34,Female,sg_1776173775880_mniv2f,diffuse,1,,psychology,high-psychology,What brain mechanisms help people make scientific discoveries?,task_end,2026-04-14T13:53:40.750Z,,,,,,,,,"To make a scientific discovery the use of Semantic memory will have to be used, which is the ability to learn facts and relationships. These elements will play a key part in being able to compare and discover new findings in science.

Going deeper into the brain, the synapses are the key functional elements of the brain. The essential function of the brain is cell-to-cell communication, and synapses are the points at which communication occurs. Without this the brain would not work or even begin to think about science.",524,,,,,,,
