11,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,34,Female,sg_1776173775880_mniv2f,diffuse,2,,art_history,high-art-history,How do ancient works of art play a role in contemporary society?,answer_snapshot,2026-04-14T14:03:17.421Z,,,,,,,"Ancient works of art play an important role in how we understand the past. Many pieces of art from civilisations such as ancient Egypt, ancient Greece and the Sumerians of Mesopotamia are used to piece together puzzles of how life was in that time, and that allows us to grow in contemporary society. Learning from the past is important for modern and future societies, allowing for a broad understanding of humans",414,,,,,,,debounce,,
