13,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,38,Male,sg_1776175539831_hxn9r8,diffuse,0,1,practice,practice-capybaras,What do Capybaras eat?,paste,2026-04-14T14:07:06.666Z,,,,,,,,,,,"Capybaras are herbivores, grazing mainly on grasses and aquatic plants,[14][24] as well as fruit and tree bark.[",112,,,,,
