13,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,38,Male,sg_1776175539831_hxn9r8,diffuse,1,,art_history,high-art-history,How do ancient works of art play a role in contemporary society?,answer_snapshot,2026-04-14T14:18:41.820Z,,,,,,,"Ancient works of art inform and guide modern understanding of art. Everyperiod of art since the pre written era has been a building block unto the modern state of art. Even post modern art is informed by eras that have come before. Many pieces of ancient art are still displayed and revered and although modern art may differ wildly in composition and style, they are still standing on the feet of giants. Ancient art also has a historical compeont as they give brief insights into the life and culture of ancient civilizations that do not have fully recorded history. Even in ancient times, not all art was considered high art. Pliny the Younger complained of the declining state of Roman portrait art, ""The painting of portraits which used to transmit through the ages the accurate likenesses of people, has entirely gone out [...] Indolence has destroyed the arts.""",868,,,,,,,debounce,,
13,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,38,Male,sg_1776175539831_hxn9r8,diffuse,1,,art_history,high-art-history,How do ancient works of art play a role in contemporary society?,answer_snapshot,2026-04-14T14:18:57.605Z,,,,,,,"Ancient works of art inform and guide modern understanding of art. Everyperiod of art since the pre written era has been a building block unto the modern state of art. Even post modern art is informed by eras that have come before. Many pieces of ancient art are still displayed and revered and although modern art may differ wildly in composition and style, they are still standing on the feet of giants. Ancient art also has a historical compeont as they give brief insights into the life and culture of ancient civilizations that do not have fully recorded history. Even in ancient times, not all art was considered high art. Pliny the Younger complained of the declining state of Roman portrait art, ""The painting of portraits which used to transmit through the ages the accurate likenesses of people, has entirely gone out  Indolence has destroyed the arts. Another example that shows insight into an ancient culuture.",923,,,,,,,debounce,,
