14,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,30,Male,sg_1776177548786_ryltzr,clumpy,0,1,practice,practice-capybaras,What do Capybaras eat?,paste,2026-04-14T14:44:12.381Z,,,,,,,,,,,"They eat a greater variety of plants during the dry season, as fewer plants are available. While they eat grass during the wet season, they have to switch to more abundant reeds during the dry season.[",201,,,,,
