15,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,34,Female,sg_1776177591849_ac6hd9,clumpy,0,1,practice,practice-capybaras,What do Capybaras eat?,answer_snapshot,2026-04-14T14:47:49.150Z,,,,,,,"The capybara is a herbivore, and mainly feeds on grasses and aquatic plants. the capybara's name means 'one who eats slender leaves', or 'grass eater'. ",152,,,,,,,debounce,,
