15,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,34,Female,sg_1776177591849_ac6hd9,clumpy,0,1,practice,practice-capybaras,What do Capybaras eat?,answer_snapshot,2026-04-14T14:48:48.020Z,,,,,,,"The capybara is a herbivore, and mainly feeds on grasses and aquatic plants, but also on fruit and tree bark. The capybara's name means 'one who eats slender leaves', or 'grass eater'. ",185,,,,,,,debounce,,
