15,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,34,Female,sg_1776177591849_ac6hd9,clumpy,1,,psychology,high-psychology,What brain mechanisms help people make scientific discoveries?,answer_snapshot,2026-04-14T15:02:18.596Z,,,,,,,"The frontal lobe in the brain is responsible for actions such as planning, reasoning and abstract thought. These executive functions also include the ability to reason and problem solve, due to its propensity to plan, prospect and use intelligence. ",249,,,,,,,debounce,,
