15,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,34,Female,sg_1776177591849_ac6hd9,clumpy,2,,art_history,high-art-history,How do ancient works of art play a role in contemporary society?,answer_snapshot,2026-04-14T15:16:28.643Z,,,,,,,"Ancient art is able to convey to a modern society ideas of the past. Ancient art can tell us about history, art practices, ideals, religion and craftsmanship and society in previous eras in different areas of the world. Modern society also allows us as the observer to view and appreciate such art forms in museums and galleries. Through this we can wonder how such skills and crafts were possible so far back in history with the tools that they had available at the time. Ancient art can inform research and hypotheses about our timeline and history, providing education for children and adults alike. Ancient art is used in schools and universities to educate humans on our roots and differences between the past and today's society. It can help teach children the value of comparison and evaluation. Ancient art also influences modern artwork, with many artists citing ancient artwork as inspiration. ",904,,,,,,,debounce,,
