16,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,39,Male,sg_1776177739396_smrji8,clumpy,1,,art_history,high-art-history,How do ancient works of art play a role in contemporary society?,article_open,2026-04-14T14:55:14.371Z,The_Angel_of_the_North,Angel of the North,,5609,link_click,,,,,,,,,,,,
16,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,39,Male,sg_1776177739396_smrji8,clumpy,1,,art_history,high-art-history,How do ancient works of art play a role in contemporary society?,answer_snapshot,2026-04-14T14:55:59.837Z,,,,,,,"Ancient artworks are commonly found in museums and help educate people on ancient societies and ways of life. Our understanding of how cultural practices, religions, and governments emerged stems from ancient art. In many ways, art plays the same role in contemporary society as it did in ancient society. It provides a representation of how people live, as well as how they think and what values are important. For example, street art's political roots can be traced back to the ancient Roman Empire, where graffiti was used to express dissatisfaction with the ruling elite. In modern times, the evolution of street art has been closely intertwined with the political climate.",677,,,,,,,submit,,
