16,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,39,Male,sg_1776177739396_smrji8,clumpy,2,,psychology,high-psychology,What brain mechanisms help people make scientific discoveries?,answer_snapshot,2026-04-14T15:01:13.971Z,,,,,,,"To make discoveries, scientists must be attentive. Studies show that unexpected findings provoke more attention, and the brain applies more linguistic, conscious systems to help explain those findings. Discovery can also be provoked by a scientist finding what appear to be problems with their experiment. unexpected results lead a researcher to self-doubt, and to try and fix what they think is an error in their own methodology. ",431,,,,,,,debounce,,
16,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,39,Male,sg_1776177739396_smrji8,clumpy,2,,psychology,high-psychology,What brain mechanisms help people make scientific discoveries?,answer_snapshot,2026-04-14T15:01:20.597Z,,,,,,,"To make discoveries, scientists must be attentive. Studies show that unexpected findings provoke more attention, and the brain applies more linguistic, conscious systems to help explain those findings. Discovery can also be provoked by a scientist finding what appears to be problems with their experiment. unexpected results lead a researcher to self-doubt, and to try and fix what they think is an error in their own methodology. ",432,,,,,,,debounce,,
16,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,39,Male,sg_1776177739396_smrji8,clumpy,2,,psychology,high-psychology,What brain mechanisms help people make scientific discoveries?,answer_snapshot,2026-04-14T15:01:41.072Z,,,,,,,"To make discoveries, scientists must be attentive. Studies show that unexpected findings provoke more attention, and the brain applies more linguistic, conscious systems to help explain those findings. Discovery can also be provoked by a scientist finding what appears to be problems with their experiment. Unexplained or unexpected results lead a researcher to self-doubt, and to try and fix what they think is an error in their own methodology. ",447,,,,,,,debounce,,
