18,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,51,Female,sg_1776177885662_dqvdmv,diffuse,0,1,practice,practice-capybaras,What do Capybaras eat?,paste,2026-04-14T14:48:10.829Z,,,,,,,,,,,They eat a greater variety of plants during the dry season,58,,,,,
18,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,51,Female,sg_1776177885662_dqvdmv,diffuse,0,1,practice,practice-capybaras,What do Capybaras eat?,answer_snapshot,2026-04-14T14:48:12.832Z,,,,,,,"Capybaras are herbivores, grazing mainly on grasses and aquatic plants, as well as fruit and tree bark. They are very selective feeders  and feed on the leaves of one species and disregard other species surrounding it. They eat a greater variety of plants during the dry season",277,,,,,,,debounce,,
18,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,51,Female,sg_1776177885662_dqvdmv,diffuse,0,1,practice,practice-capybaras,What do Capybaras eat?,answer_snapshot_cursor_leave,2026-04-14T14:48:14.689Z,,,,,,,"Capybaras are herbivores, grazing mainly on grasses and aquatic plants, as well as fruit and tree bark. They are very selective feeders  and feed on the leaves of one species and disregard other species surrounding it. They eat a greater variety of plants during the dry season",277,,,,,,,cursor_leave,,
18,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,51,Female,sg_1776177885662_dqvdmv,diffuse,0,1,practice,practice-capybaras,What do Capybaras eat?,answer_snapshot,2026-04-14T14:48:25.880Z,,,,,,,"Capybaras are herbivores, grazing mainly on grasses and aquatic plants, as well as fruit and tree bark. They are very selective feeders  and feed on the leaves of one species and disregard other species surrounding it. They eat a greater variety of plants during the dry season. ",279,,,,,,,debounce,,
