26,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,33,Female,sg_1776179918038_z13a8u,clumpy,1,,psychology,high-psychology,What brain mechanisms help people make scientific discoveries?,answer_snapshot,2026-04-14T15:32:08.864Z,,,,,,,Well-developed prefrontal cortex and parietal lobes have been associated with scientists who have made great discoveries. ,122,,,,,,,debounce,,
26,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,33,Female,sg_1776179918038_z13a8u,clumpy,1,,psychology,high-psychology,What brain mechanisms help people make scientific discoveries?,answer_snapshot,2026-04-14T15:32:21.991Z,,,,,,,Well-developed prefrontal cortex and parietal lobes have been associated with scientists who have made great discoveries. These areas were also found to be densely packed with neurons.,184,,,,,,,debounce,,
26,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,33,Female,sg_1776179918038_z13a8u,clumpy,1,,psychology,high-psychology,What brain mechanisms help people make scientific discoveries?,answer_snapshot,2026-04-14T15:32:57.803Z,,,,,,,Well-developed prefrontal cortex and parietal lobes have been associated with scientists who have made great discoveries. These areas were also found to be densely packed with neurons. Also the absence of a typical groove in the brain known as the 'sylvian fissure' is thought to potentially allow for better communication between different brain regions.,355,,,,,,,debounce,,
26,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,33,Female,sg_1776179918038_z13a8u,clumpy,1,,psychology,high-psychology,What brain mechanisms help people make scientific discoveries?,answer_snapshot_cursor_leave,2026-04-14T15:33:52.409Z,,,,,,,Well-developed prefrontal cortex and parietal lobes have been associated with scientists who have made great discoveries. These areas were also found to be densely packed with neurons. Also the absence of a typical groove in the brain known as the 'sylvian fissure' is thought to potentially allow for better communication between different brain regions.,355,,,,,,,cursor_leave,,
