39,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,45,Female,sg_1776252886614_ey90wo,clumpy,0,1,practice,practice-capybaras,What do Capybaras eat?,answer_snapshot,2026-04-15T11:38:55.810Z,,,,,,,"The capybara feeds mainly on grasses and aquatic plants.  They find their food in their habitat of densely forested areas near bodies of water, such as lakes, rivers, swamps, ponds, and marshes,[14] as well as flooded savannah and along rivers in the tropical rainforest. They are superb swimmers and can hold their breath underwater for up to five minutes at a time.",367,,,,,,,debounce,,
