40,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,37,Female,sg_1776252972547_emrp8h,clumpy,2,,art_history,high-art-history,How do ancient works of art play a role in contemporary society?,answer_snapshot,2026-04-15T11:59:04.369Z,,,,,,,"Ancient works of art such as the paintings in the Lascaux Caves which date back to the early Magdalenian period (17-22k years ago,) influence contemporary society in a variety of ways. Countries' claims to the caves and other heritage sites can generate money, tourism, and glory as well as bring researchers to the sites. Many believe some pieces, such as rock paintings from the Cave of Beasts (Gilf Kebir, Libyan Desert) correlate with the mating cycle of animals and therefore represent an early draft of a calendar. This is also one of the earliest known pieces of evidence for a proto-writing system, something that has wide-reaching implications for ",657,,,,,,,debounce,,
40,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,37,Female,sg_1776252972547_emrp8h,clumpy,2,,art_history,high-art-history,How do ancient works of art play a role in contemporary society?,answer_snapshot,2026-04-15T11:59:26.868Z,,,,,,,"Ancient works of art such as the paintings in the Lascaux Caves which date back to the early Magdalenian period (17-22k years ago,) influence contemporary society in a variety of ways. Countries' claims to the caves and other heritage sites can generate money, tourism, and glory as well as bring researchers to the sites. Many believe some pieces, such as rock paintings from the Cave of Beasts (Gilf Kebir, Libyan Desert) correlate with the mating cycle of animals and therefore represent an early draft of a calendar. This is also one of the earliest known pieces of evidence for a proto-writing system, something that has changed the way we look at the history of text.",673,,,,,,,debounce,,
40,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,37,Female,sg_1776252972547_emrp8h,clumpy,2,,art_history,high-art-history,How do ancient works of art play a role in contemporary society?,answer_snapshot,2026-04-15T11:59:45.012Z,,,,,,,"Ancient works of art such as the paintings in the Lascaux Caves which date back to the early Magdalenian period (17-22k years ago,) influence contemporary society in a variety of ways. Countries' claims to the caves and other heritage sites can generate money, tourism, and glory as well as bring researchers to the sites. Many believe some pieces, such as rock paintings from the Cave of Beasts (Gilf Kebir, Libyan Desert) correlate with the mating cycle of animals and therefore represent an early draft of a calendar. This is also one of the earliest known pieces of evidence for a proto-writing system, something that has changed the way we look at the history of text.",673,,,,,,,submit,,
40,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,37,Female,sg_1776252972547_emrp8h,clumpy,2,,art_history,high-art-history,How do ancient works of art play a role in contemporary society?,task_end,2026-04-15T11:59:45.012Z,,,,,,,,,"Ancient works of art such as the paintings in the Lascaux Caves which date back to the early Magdalenian period (17-22k years ago,) influence contemporary society in a variety of ways. Countries' claims to the caves and other heritage sites can generate money, tourism, and glory as well as bring researchers to the sites. Many believe some pieces, such as rock paintings from the Cave of Beasts (Gilf Kebir, Libyan Desert) correlate with the mating cycle of animals and therefore represent an early draft of a calendar. This is also one of the earliest known pieces of evidence for a proto-writing system, something that has changed the way we look at the history of text.",673,,,,,,,
