41,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,25,Female,sg_1776253063412_swmccm,clumpy,0,1,practice,practice-capybaras,What do Capybaras eat?,answer_snapshot,2026-04-15T11:44:52.242Z,,,,,,,"Capybaras eat mainly grasses and aquatic plants, as they are herbivores. They will also eat fruit and tree bark - they are very selective eaters, only choosing a select number of species of plant to eat. During the dry season, they eat a much wider variety of plants as there are less available to them. ",304,,,,,,,debounce,,
41,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,25,Female,sg_1776253063412_swmccm,clumpy,0,1,practice,practice-capybaras,What do Capybaras eat?,answer_snapshot,2026-04-15T11:45:18.546Z,,,,,,,"Capybaras eat mainly grasses and aquatic plants, as they are herbivores. They will also eat fruit and tree bark - they are very selective eaters, only choosing a select number of species of plant to eat. During the dry season, they eat a much wider variety of plants as there are less available to them. During the winter, the plants lose nutritional value so they have to switch their habits",392,,,,,,,debounce,,
41,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,25,Female,sg_1776253063412_swmccm,clumpy,0,1,practice,practice-capybaras,What do Capybaras eat?,answer_snapshot,2026-04-15T11:45:22.120Z,,,,,,,"Capybaras eat mainly grasses and aquatic plants, as they are herbivores. They will also eat fruit and tree bark - they are very selective eaters, only choosing a select number of species of plant to eat. During the dry season, they eat a much wider variety of plants as there are less available to them. During the winter, the plants lose nutritional value so they have to switch their habits.",393,,,,,,,debounce,,
41,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,25,Female,sg_1776253063412_swmccm,clumpy,0,1,practice,practice-capybaras,What do Capybaras eat?,answer_snapshot,2026-04-15T11:45:54.332Z,,,,,,,"Capybaras eat mainly grasses and aquatic plants, as they are herbivores. They will also eat fruit and tree bark - they are very selective eaters, only choosing a select number of species of plant to eat. During the dry season, they eat a much wider variety of plants as there are less available to them. During the winter, the plants lose nutritional value so they have to switch their habits.
They also eat their own feces to help digest the cellulose in the grass, and get the most nutritional value from it.",510,,,,,,,debounce,,
