41,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,25,Female,sg_1776253063412_swmccm,clumpy,1,,psychology,high-psychology,What brain mechanisms help people make scientific discoveries?,paste,2026-04-15T11:49:45.939Z,,,,,,,,,,,activity-dependent modification of synapses is the brain's primary mechanism for learning and memory.,101,,,,,
41,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,25,Female,sg_1776253063412_swmccm,clumpy,1,,psychology,high-psychology,What brain mechanisms help people make scientific discoveries?,answer_snapshot,2026-04-15T11:49:47.942Z,,,,,,,"The brain is made up of lots of different parts, each responsibile for different functions. Synapses are the gaps between axons where cellular communication occurs, and activity-dependent modification of synapses is the brain's primary mechanism for learning and memory.",270,,,,,,,debounce,,
41,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,25,Female,sg_1776253063412_swmccm,clumpy,1,,psychology,high-psychology,What brain mechanisms help people make scientific discoveries?,answer_snapshot,2026-04-15T11:50:18.514Z,,,,,,,"The brain is made up of lots of different parts, each responsibile for different functions. Synapses are the gaps between axons where cellular communication occurs, and activity-dependent modification of synapses is the brain's primary mechanism for learning and memory. This is very important when it comes to making scientific discoveries, as it is required for you to learn enough about the world to understand what we do not know. ",435,,,,,,,debounce,,
41,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,25,Female,sg_1776253063412_swmccm,clumpy,1,,psychology,high-psychology,What brain mechanisms help people make scientific discoveries?,answer_snapshot_cursor_leave,2026-04-15T11:50:29.154Z,,,,,,,"The brain is made up of lots of different parts, each responsibile for different functions. Synapses are the gaps between axons where cellular communication occurs, and activity-dependent modification of synapses is the brain's primary mechanism for learning and memory. This is very important when it comes to making scientific discoveries, as it is required for you to learn enough about the world to understand what we do not know. ",435,,,,,,,cursor_leave,,
41,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,25,Female,sg_1776253063412_swmccm,clumpy,1,,psychology,high-psychology,What brain mechanisms help people make scientific discoveries?,answer_snapshot,2026-04-15T11:51:38.092Z,,,,,,,"The brain is made up of lots of different parts, each responsibile for different functions. Synapses are the gaps between axons where cellular communication occurs, and activity-dependent modification of synapses is the brain's primary mechanism for learning and memory. This is very important when it comes to making scientific discoveries, as it is required for you to learn enough about the world to understand what we do not know. 
In order to make these discoveries, you must learn the information, but also process it",523,,,,,,,debounce,,
