There are elements of ancient art that are still adopted today such as styles (neolithic), and certain painting traditions that are still employed today, such as the Tomb of the Diver. We often display these works of art in museums to ensure that people do not forget them, and can appreciate the beauty of seeing them.",839,,,,,,,submit,,
