43,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,58,Male,sg_1776254020940_70tgcw,diffuse,0,1,practice,practice-capybaras,What do Capybaras eat?,answer_snapshot,2026-04-15T11:58:41.202Z,,,,,,,"Capybaras is a semi-aquatic herbivorous rodent mammal found in South America and lives in dense forests and savannas.

They graze mainly on grasses, fruit and tree bark.

They are very selective feeders[25] and feed on the leaves of one species and disregard other species surrounding it. They eat a greater variety of plants during the dry season, as fewer plants are available. While they eat grass during the wet season, they have to switch to more abundant reeds during the dry season.[26] Plants that capybaras eat during the summer lose their nutritional value in the winter, so they are not consumed at that time",619,,,,,,,debounce,,
