44,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,30,Male,sg_1776254146768_qlli4f,diffuse,0,1,practice,practice-capybaras,What do Capybaras eat?,answer_snapshot,2026-04-15T11:59:39.366Z,,,,,,,"Capybaras are herbivores and mainly graze on grasses and aquatic plants. They are very selective feeders and will feed on the leaves of one species while disregarding others around it. The time of year impacts their feeding habits as during the dry season, there are fewer plants available and therefore they eat a wider range of plants than in the wet season when there is an abundance of ",390,,,,,,,debounce,,
44,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,30,Male,sg_1776254146768_qlli4f,diffuse,0,1,practice,practice-capybaras,What do Capybaras eat?,answer_snapshot_cursor_leave,2026-04-15T11:59:44.282Z,,,,,,,"Capybaras are herbivores and mainly graze on grasses and aquatic plants. They are very selective feeders and will feed on the leaves of one species while disregarding others around it. The time of year impacts their feeding habits as during the dry season, there are fewer plants available and therefore they eat a wider range of plants than in the wet season when there is an abundance of plants ",397,,,,,,,cursor_leave,,
44,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,30,Male,sg_1776254146768_qlli4f,diffuse,0,1,practice,practice-capybaras,What do Capybaras eat?,answer_snapshot,2026-04-15T11:59:44.328Z,,,,,,,"Capybaras are herbivores and mainly graze on grasses and aquatic plants. They are very selective feeders and will feed on the leaves of one species while disregarding others around it. The time of year impacts their feeding habits as during the dry season, there are fewer plants available and therefore they eat a wider range of plants than in the wet season when there is an abundance of plants ",397,,,,,,,submit,,
