53,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,49,Female,sg_1776256452227_mshq8o,diffuse,0,1,practice,practice-capybaras,What do Capybaras eat?,answer_snapshot,2026-04-15T12:39:18.578Z,,,,,,,"Capybaras are herbivores. Herbivores are animals which have evolved to feed on plants. As herbivores which are evolved to feed on plants, they eat mainly grasses and aquatic plants such as water lilies, as well as fruit and tree bark. ",235,,,,,,,debounce,,
