54,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,42,Female,sg_1776256953248_y9fw8r,diffuse,0,1,practice,practice-capybaras,What do Capybaras eat?,answer_snapshot,2026-04-15T12:49:52.415Z,,,,,,,"Capybaras, like most rodents, are herbivores and eat mostly grass and aquatic plants, but are selective in the plants that they eat. They also eat their own feces to help them digest the food they eat better. They are unable to synthesize vitamin c, so much be supplemented with it or they can develop gym disease.",314,,,,,,,debounce,,
54,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,42,Female,sg_1776256953248_y9fw8r,diffuse,0,1,practice,practice-capybaras,What do Capybaras eat?,answer_snapshot,2026-04-15T12:50:26.956Z,,,,,,,"Capybaras, like most rodents, are herbivores and eat mostly grass and aquatic plants, but are selective in the plants that they eat. They also eat their own feces as a source of gut bacteria to help them digest the food they eat better. They are unable to synthesize vitamin c, so much be supplemented with it or they can develop gym disease.",342,,,,,,,debounce,,
