54,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,42,Female,sg_1776256953248_y9fw8r,diffuse,0,1,practice,practice-capybaras,What do Capybaras eat?,paste,2026-04-15T12:51:45.798Z,,,,,,,,,,,"They eat a greater variety of plants during the dry season, as fewer plants are available.",90,,,,,
54,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,42,Female,sg_1776256953248_y9fw8r,diffuse,0,1,practice,practice-capybaras,What do Capybaras eat?,answer_snapshot,2026-04-15T12:51:47.812Z,,,,,,,"Capybaras, like most rodents, are herbivores and eat mostly grass and aquatic plants, but are selective in the plants that they eat.They eat a greater variety of plants during the dry season, as fewer plants are available. They also eat their own feces as a source of gut bacteria to help them digest the food they eat better. They are unable to synthesize vitamin c, so much be supplemented with it or they can develop gym disease.",432,,,,,,,debounce,,
