56,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,41,Female,sg_1776257219882_ivri1v,clumpy,0,1,practice,practice-capybaras,What do Capybaras eat?,answer_snapshot,2026-04-15T12:48:45.300Z,,,,,,,"Capybaras are herbivores, grazing mainly on grasses and aquatic plants, as well as fruit and tree bark. They an be very fussy and will feed on some species but not others. Durihng wet season they tend to just eat grass",218,,,,,,,debounce,,
56,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,41,Female,sg_1776257219882_ivri1v,clumpy,0,1,practice,practice-capybaras,What do Capybaras eat?,answer_snapshot,2026-04-15T12:48:47.809Z,,,,,,,"Capybaras are herbivores, grazing mainly on grasses and aquatic plants, as well as fruit and tree bark. They an be very fussy and will feed on some species but not others. During wet season they tend to just eat grass",217,,,,,,,debounce,,
56,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,41,Female,sg_1776257219882_ivri1v,clumpy,0,1,practice,practice-capybaras,What do Capybaras eat?,answer_snapshot,2026-04-15T12:48:53.033Z,,,,,,,"Capybaras are herbivores, grazing mainly on grasses and aquatic plants, as well as fruit and tree bark. They an be very fussy and will feed on some species but not others. During wet season they tend to just eat grass. ",219,,,,,,,debounce,,
56,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,41,Female,sg_1776257219882_ivri1v,clumpy,0,1,practice,practice-capybaras,What do Capybaras eat?,answer_snapshot,2026-04-15T12:49:10.548Z,,,,,,,"Capybaras are herbivores, grazing mainly on grasses and aquatic plants, as well as fruit and tree bark. They an be very fussy and will feed on some species but not others. During wet season they tend to just eat grass. They will also eat their own faeces ",255,,,,,,,debounce,,
56,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,41,Female,sg_1776257219882_ivri1v,clumpy,0,1,practice,practice-capybaras,What do Capybaras eat?,answer_snapshot,2026-04-15T12:49:18.559Z,,,,,,,"Capybaras are herbivores, grazing mainly on grasses and aquatic plants, as well as fruit and tree bark. They an be very fussy and will feed on some species but not others. During wet season they tend to just eat grass. They will also eat their own faeces for digestion",268,,,,,,,debounce,,
56,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,41,Female,sg_1776257219882_ivri1v,clumpy,0,1,practice,practice-capybaras,What do Capybaras eat?,answer_snapshot,2026-04-15T12:49:27.720Z,,,,,,,"Capybaras are herbivores, grazing mainly on grasses and aquatic plants, as well as fruit and tree bark. They an be very fussy and will feed on some species but not others. During wet season they tend to just eat grass. They will also eat their own faeces for digestion due to the cellulose in their diet. ",305,,,,,,,debounce,,
56,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,41,Female,sg_1776257219882_ivri1v,clumpy,0,1,practice,practice-capybaras,What do Capybaras eat?,answer_snapshot_cursor_leave,2026-04-15T12:49:45.761Z,,,,,,,"Capybaras are herbivores, grazing mainly on grasses and aquatic plants, as well as fruit and tree bark. They an be very fussy and will feed on some species but not others. During wet season they tend to just eat grass. They will also eat their own faeces for digestion due to the cellulose in their diet. ",305,,,,,,,cursor_leave,,
