57,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,27,Female,sg_1776257316007_f4ea8c,clumpy,0,1,practice,practice-capybaras,What do Capybaras eat?,answer_snapshot,2026-04-15T12:50:10.340Z,,,,,,,Capybaras are herbivores. They feed mainly on grass and aquatic plants. They also feed on fruit and tree bark. ,111,,,,,,,debounce,,
57,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,27,Female,sg_1776257316007_f4ea8c,clumpy,0,1,practice,practice-capybaras,What do Capybaras eat?,answer_snapshot,2026-04-15T12:50:44.370Z,,,,,,,"Capybaras are herbivores. They feed mainly on grass and aquatic plants. They also feed on fruit and tree bark. It can also vary per season, their diet is the same but quanity is different. In dry months ",203,,,,,,,debounce,,
57,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,27,Female,sg_1776257316007_f4ea8c,clumpy,0,1,practice,practice-capybaras,What do Capybaras eat?,answer_snapshot,2026-04-15T12:51:16.704Z,,,,,,,"Capybaras are herbivores. They feed mainly on grass and aquatic plants. They also feed on fruit and tree bark. It can also vary per season, their diet is the same but quanity is different. In dry months they eat a greater variety of plants and fewer are available to choose from but in the wet season they switch to foods that more meet their needs ",349,,,,,,,debounce,,
