59,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,21,Male,sg_1776257622048_utieoi,clumpy,2,,psychology,high-psychology,What brain mechanisms help people make scientific discoveries?,paste,2026-04-15T13:16:52.452Z,,,,,,,,,,,"credited with mathematical and scientific discoveries, such as the Pythagorean theorem, Pythagorean tuning, the five regular solids, the theory of proportions, the sphericity of the Earth, the identity of the morning and evening stars as the planet Venus, and the division of the globe into five climatic zones.",311,,,,,
59,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,21,Male,sg_1776257622048_utieoi,clumpy,2,,psychology,high-psychology,What brain mechanisms help people make scientific discoveries?,answer_snapshot,2026-04-15T13:16:54.472Z,,,,,,,"Scientific discoveries are innovative for society; just for example, in 3000 BC, Units of measurement were developed in the Americas as well as the major Bronze Age civilizations: Egypt, Mesopotamia, Elam and the Indus Valley. Another example would be Pythagoras, who is credited with mathematical and scientific discoveries, such as the Pythagorean theorem, Pythagorean tuning, the five regular solids, the theory of proportions, the sphericity of the Earth, the identity of the morning and evening stars as the planet Venus, and the division of the globe into five climatic zones.",582,,,,,,,debounce,,
59,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,21,Male,sg_1776257622048_utieoi,clumpy,2,,psychology,high-psychology,What brain mechanisms help people make scientific discoveries?,answer_snapshot_cursor_leave,2026-04-15T13:16:55.284Z,,,,,,,"Scientific discoveries are innovative for society; just for example, in 3000 BC, Units of measurement were developed in the Americas as well as the major Bronze Age civilizations: Egypt, Mesopotamia, Elam and the Indus Valley. Another example would be Pythagoras, who is credited with mathematical and scientific discoveries, such as the Pythagorean theorem, Pythagorean tuning, the five regular solids, the theory of proportions, the sphericity of the Earth, the identity of the morning and evening stars as the planet Venus, and the division of the globe into five climatic zones.",582,,,,,,,cursor_leave,,
