60,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,40,Female,sg_1776257631882_tpwqdk,diffuse,0,1,practice,practice-capybaras,What do Capybaras eat?,answer_snapshot,2026-04-15T12:57:49.447Z,,,,,,,"Capybaras are herbivores, they tend to graze on grasses and aquatic plants, as well as fruit and tree bark. While picky eaters, they ",133,,,,,,,debounce,,
60,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,40,Female,sg_1776257631882_tpwqdk,diffuse,0,1,practice,practice-capybaras,What do Capybaras eat?,answer_snapshot,2026-04-15T12:58:02.495Z,,,,,,,"Capybaras are herbivores, they tend to graze on grasses and aquatic plants, as well as fruit and tree bark. While picky eaters, they often eat one species and then decline to eat others surrounding it. ",202,,,,,,,debounce,,
60,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,40,Female,sg_1776257631882_tpwqdk,diffuse,0,1,practice,practice-capybaras,What do Capybaras eat?,answer_snapshot,2026-04-15T12:58:19.208Z,,,,,,,"Capybaras are herbivores, they tend to graze on grasses and aquatic plants, as well as fruit and tree bark. While picky eaters, they often eat one species and then decline to eat others surrounding it, but this changes during the dry season when there are fewer",261,,,,,,,debounce,,
60,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,40,Female,sg_1776257631882_tpwqdk,diffuse,0,1,practice,practice-capybaras,What do Capybaras eat?,answer_snapshot_cursor_leave,2026-04-15T12:58:30.657Z,,,,,,,"Capybaras are herbivores, they tend to graze on grasses and aquatic plants, as well as fruit and tree bark. While picky eaters, they often eat one species and then decline to eat others surrounding it, but this changes during the dry season when there are fewer",261,,,,,,,cursor_leave,,
60,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,40,Female,sg_1776257631882_tpwqdk,diffuse,0,1,practice,practice-capybaras,What do Capybaras eat?,answer_snapshot,2026-04-15T12:59:25.097Z,,,,,,,"Capybaras are herbivores, they tend to graze on grasses and aquatic plants, as well as fruit and tree bark. While picky eaters, they often eat one species and then decline to eat others surrounding it, but this changes during the dry season when there are fewer options available. ",281,,,,,,,debounce,,
60,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,40,Female,sg_1776257631882_tpwqdk,diffuse,0,1,practice,practice-capybaras,What do Capybaras eat?,answer_snapshot_cursor_leave,2026-04-15T12:59:53.698Z,,,,,,,"Capybaras are herbivores, they tend to graze on grasses and aquatic plants, as well as fruit and tree bark. While picky eaters, they often eat one species and then decline to eat others surrounding it, but this changes during the dry season when there are fewer options available. These plants they eat in the summer often are not nutritious during the winter, so the capybaras don't eat them at that time.",406,,,,,,,cursor_leave,,
