60,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,40,Female,sg_1776257631882_tpwqdk,diffuse,1,,art_history,high-art-history,How do ancient works of art play a role in contemporary society?,paste,2026-04-15T13:07:16.782Z,,,,,,,,,,,"Furthermore, although some pre-Columbian cultures developed writing in the centuries preceding the European discovery of the Americas, these advancements are, on grounds of dating, largely covered with the dedicated topic of pre-Columbian art and associated sub-topics, such as Maya art, Aztec art, and Olmec art.",313,,,,,
