62,Wikipedia_Exp_14.04,Wikipedia_Exp_13.04,46,Male,sg_1776258382920_vr5uex,diffuse,1,,art_history,high-art-history,How do ancient works of art play a role in contemporary society?,answer_snapshot,2026-04-15T13:19:25.319Z,,,,,,,"Inspiration for other art movements and modern contemporary creativity. For example Grayson Perry and his pots and urns can be said to be influenced by ancient Greece. Many of the materials we use today are a conncection to the past.

The art works themselves can be a focus for tourism and information sharing and are displayed in major museums to be viewed.

They promote historical knowledge and the history of humanity and communication. Human evolution and the demonstartion of symbolic thought.

Mythological themes and religious themes are a link to the present and serve as education and inspration.",607,,,,,,,debounce,,
